Z||000010||artherd||09-24-2001||04:35 PM||||Hi Jay, toss it in there (throw in some Red Line MTL too) and see how long it lasts  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Get rodney's external diff bearings, and maybe replace the input shaft bearing.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>posted by JayUSA77:<BR><B>I think i am going to go with a getrag transaxle 5speed and hope to #%#^ it last for more than 2 weeks. 450 HP all the time and a 150 shot of nitrous in 3rd gear on. Ill tell you guys if it holds.<BR>J<P></B>[/QUOTE]<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
